
# basePath Chapter4

::FirstContractOpenCh4 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 
//change this to dorian. 
{@PAL}      	Wow, what a thrilling game of laser-tag! 
{@Dorian}    	Thanks P.A.L.. 
{@Player}     	Oh, don't get ahead of yourself. I'm still way ahead of you.
{@Dorian}     	Sure, sure. 
{@Player}    	Plus you are a desk man now, right?  
{@Dorian}    	Hey!!! 
{@Player}	    I'm joking! Mostly...
{@Dorian}   	Ok, ok. I've got to head out. That was fun. 
{@Dorian} 		See you soon!

::BeforeSupplyChainCh4
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//incoming call

{@Blaze}     Hi Locke!
{@Blaze}     Hey, if you're around for the Kalvis Festival, you should stop by.
{@Player}    Well... I'm not sure how Mara would feel about that.
{@Blaze}     What are you talking about? We'd love to see you.
{@Player}    Thanks. Maybe I will.

{@Blaze}     Oh! Quinn said you were looking for boron.
{@Player}    Yeah. Frontier has it at Lussac, but it's expensive.
{@Blaze}     Right... well, there is another option.
{@Player}    Why do I not like the sound of that?
{@Blaze}     Ha! Velos Station. Callie can sell it to you for half the price. 
{@Player}    Wait. Velos? The pirate station?
{@Blaze}     That's the one.
{@Player}    ...What's the catch?
{@Blaze}     They're pirates, Locke.

//phone hangs up

{@PAL} 		I would advise caution in regards to the new boron source. 
{@Pal}		Callie is considered a high-risk supplier.

::AfterSupplyChainCh4 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@trigger
@once 

{@Player}    That Kalvis Festival does sound fun...
{@PAL}       Another "holiday." Kalvis has had quite a few production delays lately. Unreliable.
{@Player}    Yeah... but we both know it wasn't a festival that caused the others.
{@Player}    ...Sounds fun though.
